e of the day by Princess Diana: "Carry out a random act of kindness, with no expectation of reward..."]]></title><description><![CDATA[Princess Diana's message of selfless kindness continues to inspire people globally.  Her humanitarian work demonstrated compassion without expecting any reward.  She championed causes like HIV/AIDS awareness and landmine abolition.  Diana's legacy lives on through her sons and charitable initiatives.  Her life proved that genuine empathy can be a powerful leadership form.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-princess-diana-carry-out-a-random-act-of-kindness-with-no-expectation-of-reward-/articleshow/132632415.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-princess-diana-carry-out-a-random-act-of-kindness-with-no-expectation-of-reward-/articleshow/132632415.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-26T00:01:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132632518,imgsize-51010.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Alexander the Great: "I am not afraid of an army of lions led by a sheep; I am afraid of…" - a timeless lesson on leadership, courage and the power of inspiring others]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132632291.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Leadership quality significantly impacts group achievements, often surpassing individual capabilities.  A strong leader inspires confidence and courage, which then spreads throughout the team.  This principle applies beyond warfare to various settings like classrooms and workplaces.  Talent alone without direction yields inconsistent and often disappointing results.  Therefore, developing leadership skills remains a vital investment for any organization.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-alexander-the-great-i-am-not-afraid-of-an-army-of-lions-led-by-a-sheep-i-am-afraid-of-a-timeless-lesson-on-leadership-courage-and-the-power-of-inspiring-others/articleshow/132632291.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-alexander-the-great-i-am-not-afraid-of-an-army-of-lions-led-by-a-sheep-i-am-afraid-of-a-timeless-lesson-on-leadership-courage-and-the-power-of-inspiring-others/articleshow/132632291.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T23:59:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132632316,imgsize-248770.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Nothing compares to home, but…’: Indian man explains why many people end up staying in US]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132630687.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nothing-compares-to-home-but-indian-man-explains-why-many-people-end-up-staying-in-us/articleshow/132630687.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nothing-compares-to-home-but-indian-man-explains-why-many-people-end-up-staying-in-us/articleshow/132630687.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T23:10:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132631195,imgsize-749385.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Zebra mussels spread across all Great Lakes within a decade of arriving in 1988]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132628994.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Zebra mussels, an aquatic invader from Eurasia, continue their continental spread after arriving in North America.  These tiny shellfish are now infesting Lake Meredith in Texas, raising new concerns.  Officials confirmed a reproducing population, marking the lake as a potential stepping stone.  The mussels damage ecosystems and infrastructure by clinging to hard surfaces and multiplying rapidly.  Preventative measures like cleaning boats remain crucial to slowing their ongoing invasion.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1988-zebra-mussels-arrived-in-north-america-through-a-ships-ballast-water-within-10-years-they-had-spread-across-all-five-great-lakes/articleshow/132628994.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1988-zebra-mussels-arrived-in-north-america-through-a-ships-ballast-water-within-10-years-they-had-spread-across-all-five-great-lakes/articleshow/132628994.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T20:47:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132629028,imgsize-173166.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[He rejected to work for a Jew boss. Now he has $25,000 in donation money and Cornell did not take any action against him]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132630376.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/he-rejected-to-work-for-a-jew-boss-now-he-has-25000-in-donation-money-and-cornell-did-not-take-any-action-against-him/articleshow/132630376.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/he-rejected-to-work-for-a-jew-boss-now-he-has-25000-in-donation-money-and-cornell-did-not-take-any-action-against-him/articleshow/13263037