title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132629154.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-details-emerge-about-nyc-stabber-raul-morales-quran-bible-book-on-che-guevara-marx-found-from-his-apartment/articleshow/132629154.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-details-emerge-about-nyc-stabber-raul-morales-quran-bible-book-on-che-guevara-marx-found-from-his-apartment/articleshow/132629154.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T20:49:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132629171,imgsize-178072.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists stunned as African lake fly larvae defy deep-sea survival limits]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132628150.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Lake fly larvae in Lake Malawi exhibit a remarkable daily vertical migration. These Chaoborus edulis larvae possess specialized air sacs for buoyancy control.  A unique pH-powered mechanism allows them to precisely manage their depth.  These larvae can withstand extreme pressures, challenging previous scientific assumptions.  This discovery offers insights into insect evolution and potential material science applications.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/scientists-thought-insects-could-never-survive-the-deep-ocean-because-their-air-filled-bodies-would-implode-but-lake-fly-larvae-in-africas-lake-malawi-are-proving-them-wrong/articleshow/132628150.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/scientists-thought-insects-could-never-survive-the-deep-ocean-because-their-air-filled-bodies-would-implode-but-lake-fly-larvae-in-africas-lake-malawi-are-proving-them-wrong/articleshow/132628150.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T19:45:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132628232,imgsize-64425.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Way better than America's Independence Day': Texas influencer enraged by advertisement for Indian Independence Day event in Frisco]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132628822.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/way-better-than-americas-independence-day-texas-influencers-enraged-by-advertisement-for-indian-independence-day-event-in-frisco/articleshow/132628822.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/way-better-than-americas-independence-day-texas-influencers-enraged-by-advertisement-for-indian-independence-day-event-in-frisco/articleshow/132628822.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T20:18:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132628854,imgsize-178664.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘He spoke briefly, then fired’: Indian-origin woman shot dead in targeted Toronto attack]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132626807.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/he-spoke-briefly-then-fired-indian-origin-woman-shot-dead-in-targeted-toronto-attack/articleshow/132626807.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/he-spoke-briefly-then-fired-indian-origin-woman-shot-dead-in-targeted-toronto-attack/articleshow/132626807.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T19:02:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132626850,imgsize-312706.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Flesh-eating parasite moves toward US—scientists find it may be stopped by a scent]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132626406.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A dangerous parasite is spreading north, prompting urgent research into its specific attractants. Scientists are investigating foul-smelling chemical signals that lure the New World screwworm. This flesh-eating fly lays eggs in open wounds, feeding on living animal flesh. Current traps attract related flies, making detection of the dangerous species difficult. Understanding the parasite's preferred odors could lead to better detection and control methods.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-dangerous-parasite-is-spreading-north-through-central-america-into-the-us-and-its-weakness-may-be-a-very-specific-smell/articleshow/132626406.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-dangerous-parasite-is-spreading-north-through-central-america-into-the-us-and-its-weakness-may-be-a-very-specific-smell/articleshow/132626406.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T18:44:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132626546,imgsize-84289.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[After poaching erased wildlife, 12 giraffes may rescue this Uganda reserve]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132625570.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Uganda is moving endangered Nubian giraffes from Murchison Falls National Park to Ajai Wildlife Reserve. This relocation aims to protect the species from oil drilling and habitat pressures. Ajai Wildlife Reserve is undergoing ecological restoration and reintroduction of various animal species. Local communities are actively engaged and benefit from conservation efforts. The initiative seeks to foster coexistence between development and wildlife preservation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-the-early-1980s-poaching-wiped-out-all-wildlife-in-this-ugandan-reserve-now-12-giraffes-are-being-brought-back-to-save-them-from-oil-drilling/articleshow/132625570.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-the-early-1980s-poaching-wiped-out-all-wildlife-in-this-ugandan-reserve-now-12-giraffes-are-being-brought-back-to-save-them-from-oil-drilling/articleshow/132625570.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T17:51:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132625576,imgsize-179792.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UK industrial fire: Essex fertiliser explosion injures 20 firefighters, destroys 3 fire engines]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132628791.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-industrial-fire-essex-fertiliser-explosion-injures-20-firefighters-destroys-3-fire-engines/articleshow/132628791.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-industrial-fire-essex-fertiliser-explosion-injures-20-firefighters-destroys-3-fire-engines/articleshow/132628791.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T20:39:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132629041,imgsize-47080.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin athlete run over by drunk driver in Ohio, Warren JFK football community mourns Sarosh Sheth's death]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132626125.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-athlete-run-over-by-drunk-driver-in-ohio-warren-jfk-football-community-mourns-sarosh-sheths-death/articleshow/132626125.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-athlete-run-over-by-drunk-driver-in-ohio-warren-jfk-football-community-mourns-sarosh-sheths-death/articleshow/132626125.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T18:18:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132626197,imgsize-60424.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘He is definitely afraid of Florida’: 11-year-old boy's family vacation turned into a nightmare after a brutal alligator attack]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132625410.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[An 11-year-old boy named Brodie Dituri suffered a severe alligator attack while fishing in Florida. His father bravely intervened, and bystanders assisted until emergency services arrived. The incident resulted in the loss of Brodie's dominant right hand and a long recovery period. He is now undergoing extensive medical treatment and rehabilitation back home. The family's annual Florida tradition has ended due to Brodie's fear of returning.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/he-is-definitely-afraid-of-florida-11-year-old-boys-family-vacation-turned-into-a-nightmare-after-a-brutal-alligator-attack/articleshow/132625410.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/he-is-definitely-afraid-of-florida-11-year-old-boys-family-vacation-turned-into-a-nightmare-after-a-brutal-alligator-attack/articleshow/132625410.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T17:49:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132625510,imgsize-185760.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Human remains found in chest freezer at Alaska home during family clean-up, police probe underway]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132625473.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/human-remains-found-in-chest-freezer-at-alaska-home-during-family-clean-up-police-probe-underway/articleshow/132625473.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/human-remains-found-in-chest-freezer-at-alaska-home-during-family-clean-up-police-probe-underway/articleshow/132625473.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T17:44:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132625513,imgsize-765877.cms"/></item></channel></rss>